#. module: billboard_rental
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:billboard_rental.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<span class=\"oe-tabs\" style=\"width: 40px;\"> </span>​But others are "
"looking for guidance. In that case, they book a meeting"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"oe-tabs\" style=\"width: 40px;\"> </span>ແຕ່ບາງຄົນກໍກຳລັງຊອກຫາຄຳແນະ"
"ນຳ. ໃນກໍລະນີນັ້ນ, ເຂົາເຈົ້າຈະຈອງການປະຊຸມ"

#. module: billboard_rental
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:billboard_rental.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<span class=\"oe-tabs\" style=\"width: 40px;\"> </span>​From there, an "
"Opportunity is created in the the CRM and a salesperson is assigned to that "
"request.<br/>\n"
"                    <span class=\"oe-tabs\" style=\"width: 40px;\"> </span>​"
"After some preliminary discussions, the lead will move to the Territory "
"Research stage, where the salesperson <span class=\"oe-tabs\" style=\"width: "
"1.28333px;\"> </span>​will perform some\n"
"                    analysis to see which of the available billboard_rental "
"is best for their campaign"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"oe-tabs\" style=\"width: 40px;\"> </span>ຈາກນັ້ນ, ໂອກາດຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃ"
"ນ CRM ແລະ ພະນັກງານຂາຍຈະຖືກມອບໝາຍໃຫ້ກັບຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍດັ່ງກ່າວ.<br/>\n"
"                    <span class=\"oe-tabs\" style=\"width: 40px;\"> </span>ຫຼັງ"
"ຈາກການສົນທະນາເບື້ອງຕົ້ນ, ລູກຄ້າເປົ້າໝາຍຈະຍ້າຍໄປສູ່ຂັ້ນຕອນການຄົ້ນຄວ້າພື້ນທີ່, ເຊິ່ງພະນັກງານຂາຍ <span "
"class=\"oe-tabs\" style=\"width: 1.28333px;\"> </span>ຈະດຳເນີນການວິເຄາະ\n"
"                    ເພື່ອເບິ່ງວ່າການເຊົ່າປ້າຍໂຄສະນາໃດທີ່ວ່າງຢູ່ເໝາະສົມທີ່ສຸດສຳລັບແຄມເປນຂອງພວກເຂົ"
"າ"

#. module: billboard_rental
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:billboard_rental.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<span class=\"oe-tabs\" style=\"width: 40px;\"> </span>​Further down the "
"process a Quotation is created. This is where the available Billboard will "
"be selected.<br/>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"oe-tabs\" style=\"width: 40px;\"> </span>ໃນຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ມາ ໃບສະເໜີລາຄາຈ"
"ະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ. ນີ້ແມ່ນຈຸດທີ່ຈະເລືອກປ້າຍໂຄສະນາທີ່ວ່າງຢູ່.<br/>"

#. module: billboard_rental
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:billboard_rental.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<span class=\"oe-tabs\" style=\"width: 40px;\"> </span>​It is also at this "
"point that one needs to decide which kind of subscription to use (short or "
"long term)."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"oe-tabs\" style=\"width: 40px;\"> </span>ນອກຈາກນີ້ຍັງເປັນຈຸດທີ່ຕ້ອງຕັດສິນ"
"ໃຈວ່າຈະເລືອກໃຊ້ຮູບແບບການເຊົ່າຕໍ່ເນື່ອງປະເພດໃດ (ໄລຍະສັ້ນ ຫຼື ໄລຍະຍາວ)."

#. module: billboard_rental
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:billboard_rental.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<span class=\"oe-tabs\" style=\"width: 40px;\"> </span>​The company handles "
"two kinds of leads.<br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <span class=\"oe-tabs\" style=\"width: 40px;\"> </span>​"
"First, they get requests from customers that want a specific "
"billboard_rental, for example because they saw it in the <span class=\"oe-"
"tabs\" style=\"width: 15.3px;\"> </span>​streets. For those\n"
"                    a lead is created manually, directly in the CRM, while "
"the prospect is on the phone."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"oe-tabs\" style=\"width: 40px;\"> </span>ບໍລິສັດຈັດການກັບລູກຄ້າເປົ້າໝາຍສ"
"ອງປະເພດ.<br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <span class=\"oe-tabs\" style=\"width: 40px;\"> </span>ກ່ອ"
"ນອື່ນໝົດ, ເຂົາເຈົ້າໄດ້ຮັບຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍຈາກລູກຄ້າທີ່ຕ້ອງການເຊົ່າປ້າຍໂຄສະນາສະເພາະ, ຕົວຢ່າງຍ້ອນພວກເຂົາເຫັນມັນຕ"
"າມ <span class=\"oe-tabs\" style=\"width: 15.3px;\"> </span>ຖະໜົນຫົນທາງ. ສຳລັບກຸ່ມ"
"ນີ້\n"
"                    ຂໍ້ມູນລູກຄ້າຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໂດຍກົງໃນ CRM ໃນຂະນະທີ່ກຳລັງລົມໂທລະສັບກັບ"
"ລູກຄ້າ."

#. module: billboard_rental
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:billboard_rental.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<span class=\"oe-tabs\" style=\"width: 40px;\"> </span>​To quickly encode the "
"orders, salespersons use Quotation Templates, that already contain the basic "
"packages."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"oe-tabs\" style=\"width: 40px;\"> </span>ເພື່ອປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນຄຳສັ່ງຊື້ຢ່າງວ່ອງໄ"
"ວ, ພະນັກງານຂາຍຈະໃຊ້ແມ່ແບບໃບສະເໜີລາຄາ ທີ່ມີແພັກເກດພື້ນຖານໄວ້ໃຫ້ແລ້ວ."

